.TH BSPLINE 1
.SH NAME
bspline \- quadratic and cubic B-splines through the same points
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/bspline
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I BSpline
is a port of the TempleOS
.B Demo/Graphics/BSpline.HC
demonstration.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Click up to sixteen control points with the left button, each marked
with a green circle, and press the right button when finished.
The same points are then drawn through twice: the quadratic
.RB ( Gr2BSpline )
in red and the cubic
.RB ( Gr3BSpline )
in blue, both closed.
Comparing them is the demonstration \- the quadratic touches the
midpoint of every edge of the control polygon and the cubic passes
through none of the points at all.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF "right button"
.TP
.B "left button"
Place a control point
.TP
.B "right button"
Finish and draw
.TP
.B "any key"
Exit, once the curves are drawn
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/bspline.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR zing (1),
.IR wm (1)
